  "_file": "The default benchmark with strength sweeps: the default attack set, plus extra versions of Bandstop, GaussianNoise, Highpass, InvertedTimeStretch, Mp3Compression, ResamplingPoly and TimeStretch. Write it with: deepmark-benchmark --init default_sweep > my_default_sweep.json, set general.wav_files_dir, general.report_dir and models, then run: deepmark-benchmark --config my_default_sweep.json. Keys starting with _ are comments. Check without running: add --validate-only. Every setting, commented: --init benchmark.",
